  "description": "UNFURNISHED - MUST VIEW - Available Immediately >>> Near LUAS, shops and schools, pristine 3 bed semi-detached unfurnished house to let in an excellent location, 5 minutes walk to LUAS Green Line and numerous QBC bus routes including the Aircoach direct to Dublin Airport every 15 minutes.   Quiet estate close to UCD, good schools, Sandyford Business Park / Central Park, and a short distance from Stillorgan Shopping Centre and Dundrum Town Centre.\n\nLargely unfurnished, bright and recently decorated throughout.  Master bedroom (ensuite) plus small double and single bedroom all with wooden flooring and built in wardrobes.   Large sitting room, Large kitchen cum dining room with table / chairs and dresser for additional storage.  Mature garden to rear (very private, not overlooked) with patio and garden shed.  Driveway and garden to front with plenty of parking.  GFCH, Alarm.\n\nSeeking a long-term tenant(s) in full-time employment.  Maximum of 3 paying tenants sharing.\n\nNon-Smokers.  No Pets.",
